/* 6个区域深层事件 × 3段 = 18段（每个区域一条3段探索小链，末端产出信物与线索） */

:: MP Extra Deep Foghorn 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>>
海蚀回音廊最深处的石壁裂开一道仅容一人侧身通过的盐晶窄缝，低频的潮鸣正从裂缝下方的海蚀暗穴传来。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回外层区域 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[侧身钻过盐晶窄缝 (0:07)|MP Extra Deep Foghorn 2]]>><<pass 7>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[用铁片刮平挡路盐柱 (0:07)|MP Extra Deep Foghorn 2]]>><<pass 7>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Extra Deep Foghorn 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>>
海蚀暗穴中央积着一汪随外海潮汐起伏的墨绿深潭，潭边石桩上拴着一截浸透焦油的旧港引航铜链。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[原路退回外层 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[拽起引航铜链探摸底匣 (0:08)|MP Extra Deep Foghorn 3]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11600 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 250>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[顺着石桩刻痕解开盲结 (0:08)|MP Extra Deep Foghorn 3]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 250>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Extra Deep Foghorn 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKeepsake to ($mpKeepsake or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
铜链末端吊着一只封满蜂蜡的航海罗盘盒。你撬开蜡封，里面躺着一枚刻有雾角双锚纹的守塔人铜哨与半页暗礁水文图。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[带着发现返回外层 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="deep-foghorn-3">
<<investigateicon>><<link "拨开蜡封取出守塔人铜哨 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#deep-foghorn-3">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpKeepsake["keepsake_foghorn_whistle"] to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_foghorn_deep_chart"] to 1>>
	<<if ($mpFragSmugglerRing or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragSmugglerRing to ($mpFragSmugglerRing or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	你把守塔人铜哨与暗礁水文图贴身收好。<span class="green">你获得了雾角信物与外海暗流线索。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_foghorn_reward")>><<money 450>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpClues["clue_foghorn_deep_chart"] to 1>>
	冷浪扑上石台打滑了盒扣，你只来得及记下盒盖上的航向刻痕。<span class="red">指尖被冰冷铜棱刮出一道红印。</span>
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Extra Deep Clockwork 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
档案馆密库十二号黑铁柜挪开后，砖墙背面露出一扇嵌着三圈同心黄铜环的检修暗门，门后传来规律的擒纵滴答声。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回外层区域 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[按星图齿数对准黄铜环 (0:07)|MP Extra Deep Clockwork 2]]>><<pass 7>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
