:: MP Extra Deep Clockwork 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
暗门后是一间不足丈许的钟表匠密室，工作台中央立着一座仍在缓缓冲压的微型蒸汽差分机。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[原路退回外层 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[扳动泄压柄读取差分铜轮 (0:08)|MP Extra Deep Clockwork 3]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 260>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[拆开底座暗格取出手稿 (0:08)|MP Extra Deep Clockwork 3]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 250>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Extra Deep Clockwork 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<set $mpKeepsake to ($mpKeepsake or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
差分机底座弹出一只天鹅绒小匣，里面嵌着一枚蓝钢双游丝怀表芯与一张标着市政厅地下管网的蓝图。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[带着发现返回外层 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="deep-clockwork-3">
<<investigateicon>><<link "用镊子夹出蓝钢怀表芯 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#deep-clockwork-3">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $mpKeepsake["keepsake_clockwork_core"] to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_clockwork_blueprint"] to 1>>
	<<if ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragCrownGear to ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	你将蓝钢表芯与地下管网蓝图收进内袋。<span class="green">你获得了机括城信物与管网线索。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_clockwork_reward")>><<money 450>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpClues["clue_clockwork_blueprint"] to 1>>
	蒸汽余压喷出一缕热雾烫红了手背，你只来得及抄下蓝图编号。<span class="red">热雾烫痛手背，密室阀门随即回锁。</span>
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Extra Deep Abbey 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>>
暗河渡口石锚下方的铁链一直延伸进退潮后露出的拱券石洞，洞壁上刻着百年前苦修会留下的引路十字。
