<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 450>>
	<<set $mpKeepsake["keepsake_druid_antler"] to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_druid_birchmap"] to 1>>
	<<if ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragBrideFlower to ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	你将白鹿角坠饰与桦皮暗道图郑重收好。<span class="green">你获得了古石环信物与深林暗道线索。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_druid_reward")>><<money 450>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpClues["clue_druid_birchmap"] to 1>>
	树洞上方落下一蓬湿苔迷了眼睛，你只来得及记下桦皮图的走向。<span class="red">松脂刺划破了你的手背。</span>
	<<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
